\"33621,31912,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33621, 31912, 6)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Upper Rathleton</strong> (officially known as Rathleton City), is a part of the city <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a> on the island <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a> with Houses, shops and most of the NPCs. It is also the part of the city with no <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a> roaming freely, as is the case in <a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Rathleton\">Lower Rathleton</a> or the <a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a></p></div></div>","quests":["dark-trails-quest"]}